 "modules": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FOCUS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 8, CC 81 to 96\n   1 What they pay attention to\n   2 Focus shift\n   3 Narrow focus to Wide focus\n   4 Distraction\n   5 Fixation\n   6 Where the eye goes first\n   7 The object we keep seeing\n   8 A view we cannot trust\n   9 What we do not see\n  10 The camera stays too long\n  11 Everyone looks the same way\n  12 Something that doesn't belong\n  13 suite: Tunnel vision\n  14 suite: Looks away at the wrong moment\n  15 suite: Narrowing in\n  16 suite: Hidden in plain sight\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 8, CC 97 to 112\n   1 suite: Guide the eye\n   2 suite: Trust no one\n   3 suite: Leading the eye\n   4 suite: Something is wrong here\n   5 pair: When a fixation tightens, the shots get closer\n   6 pair: When a distraction pulls hard, something is missed\n   7 pair: When attention starts narrowing, it hardens into a fixation\n   8 pair: When a character's attention shrinks to one thing, they miss the warning\n   9 pair: When an object is planted, the camera comes back to it\n  10 pair: When sharp focus pulls the eye, attention narrows to one thing\n  11 pair: When too many things compete for the eye, distraction grows\n  12 pair: When the camera keeps returning to an object, questions grow\n  13 pair: When the camera stays too long, dread creeps in\n  14 pair: When the lingering shot hints at a clue, the plant is less hidden\n  15 pair: When more is kept out of sight, dread grows\n  16 pair: When we catch the false view near the end, everything flips\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 9, CC 1 to 10\n   1 pair: When the view gets less trustworthy, the misdirection grows\n   2 pair: When everyone turns to look, our eye goes there first\n   3 pair: When we wait long to see what they see, the question grows\n   4 pair: When something in the frame doesn't belong, we start wondering\n   5 pair: When the odd detail is explained only at the end, it becomes a hidden plant\n   6 pair: When the camera stays too long, the dread rises\n   7 pair: When the big thing stays off screen, the dread builds\n   8 pair: When the door closes on the couple, we imagine more than we would see\n   9 pairs: Eyes on one thing\n  10 pairs: Clue in plain sight"
   },
   "pos": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
